  "body": "What happens: on main (15ad9289) the app test binary `coarse_rims` does not compile: `crates/app/tests/coarse_rims.rs:119`, the `Tool { .. }` literal in `thread_mill`, fails with \"missing field `cutting`\". `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets` and the app test build fail with it.\n\nCause: PR #1076 added `Tool::cutting`; the `coarse_rims` suite reached main in a separate PR and each merged cleanly on its own (a compile break that mergeability does not show).\n\nFound by: the review of PR #773 (trial merge with main).\n\nExpected: main builds; the literal carries `cutting: Vec::new()` (as the other `Tool` literals got in #1076).\n\nDone means: `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test coarse_rims` builds and passes on main, and `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` is clean.\n",
